swer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":false,"failures":["serious: took longer than 10 s to decide"],"credit":0,"reply":"","calls":[],"decisionMs":10000,"totalMs":10001.273834,"steps":0,"generatedTokens":0,"timedOut":true},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1261.9454169999954,"totalMs":1261.9610419999954,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1260.6362080000035,"totalMs":1260.6499580000018,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Stopped recording.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1241.2652920000037,"totalMs":1496.7506250000006,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":17,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I cannot delete files from the camera card.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1105.8969579999975,"totalMs":1105.9074160000018,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The battery is at 80%.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1247.9935830000031,"totalMs":1248.0035000000062,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I've lowered the ISO to make it a bit darker.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.5,"using":"iso"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1429.2096670000028,"totalMs":1889.8750839999993,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":35,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":false,"failures":["serious: not recording"],"credit":0,"reply":"I cannot perform camera movements or physical rotations.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1254.224500000004,"totalMs":1254.2415420000034,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1576.5769169999985,"totalMs":1576.5860829999947,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1462.0482909999992,"totalMs":1462.058791000003,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeti